    "process_summary": "The car insurance claim process begins with the customer submitting claim documentation. The notification department checks the documentation and registers the claim. The handling department then checks the insurance and performs an assessment. If the claim is rejected, the customer is notified. If the claim is approved, a repair is arranged with a garage, and payment is scheduled. Finally, the customer is notified of the claim resolution. The Garage receives damage information and payment details during the repair and payment scheduling. ",
